Description:It is your first main phase. You control Grizzly Bears and have Lightning Bolt, Raging Goblin and Bonesplitter in hand, with two red and two colorless mana floating. The opponent is at 7 life and controls a tapped Ethersworn Canonist (each player who has cast a nonartifact spell this turn can't cast additional nonartifact spells). Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-canonist-artifact-spell | Ethersworn Canonist stops only a second nonartifact spell (CR 101.2): cast Lightning Bolt (3) as your one nonartifact spell, then the artifact Bonesplitter and equip it (CR 702.6a) for a 4-power attack; Raging Goblin after Bolt can't be cast, and the hasty Goblin instead of Bolt totals 5
